{% doc %}
  A block's font, size and colour, written as the custom properties its owner
  folds into its own style attribute. Static, so the type settings sit beside
  the block instead of lengthening its own list.

  @param {string} [preset] - The owner's preset, which decides whether these apply.
  @param {string} [color] - The owner's colour mode.
{% enddoc %}

{%- render 'block-typography', block: block.settings, preset: preset, color: color -%}

